CONTEXT: PL/pgSQL function g6_leak(text) line 1 at RAISE
NOTICE 00000: g6_leak => e3
CONTEXT: PL/pgSQL function g6_leak(text) line 1 at RAISE
id:int4 | v:text | id:int4 | v:text
3 | e3 | 7 | o7
